Package: linuxkeeper
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2
Recommends: libpulse0, pipewire
Description: Linux audio keep-alive daemon
 LinuxKeeper keeps Bluetooth and USB audio devices alive by continuously
 playing inaudible silent audio, preventing automatic disconnection or
 power-saving suspend on audio interfaces.
 .
 This is the Linux equivalent of Windows SoundKeeper. It supports
 PipeWire, PulseAudio, ALSA, and OSS backends with automatic detection.
